#describe what A guide in the PR record, written by sync.mjs pr --guide-file and gated by verify --require-guide.
#describe what Delegates write it; the review screen opens on it.
#describe before The review screen shows files in review order; nothing groups hunks by intent.
#describe after A PR with a guide opens as 1-8 steps in reading order with only their own hunks.
#describe verified typecheck, lint, pnpm test and CI on each item PR; e2e pr-review-guide.spec; screenshots of the demo PR.
